WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.530
Did you listen to our song?

00:00:15.820 --> 00:00:19.700
Please let us enter the Triple S.

00:00:36.370 --> 00:00:41.740
Your revolution is not yet complete!

00:02:38.480 --> 00:02:41.080
We did our best!

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:44.510
Didn't you listen to the demo 
we wrote with Nanami?

00:02:45.050 --> 00:02:48.770
We gave everything we had 
to produce the ultimate song.

00:02:49.210 --> 00:02:52.040
We received high praise 
for our Cross-Unit Project.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.360
No, even more than that.

00:02:56.310 --> 00:03:02.040
We've broken out of our shells and grown.

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:06.830
We want everyone in the world to hear our song.

00:03:07.220 --> 00:03:11.830
We want to be the Triple S opening artist.

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:19.800
I ask that you consider them, too.

00:03:19.800 --> 00:03:21.880
I felt it while composing the song.

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:26.640
Right now, STARISH is as 
wonderful as QUARTET NIGHT.

00:03:29.200 --> 00:03:33.280
I am 100% aware of this.

00:03:33.730 --> 00:03:38.070
Because of Love

00:03:34.330 --> 00:03:38.070
But it's still not quite

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.310
a revolution.

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:45.930
What do you mean?

00:03:57.920 --> 00:04:02.250
You didn't even knock. What happened?

00:04:15.630 --> 00:04:20.730
Objectively speaking, 
STARISH is good enough to enter.

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:23.450
It's meaningless to perform without them.

00:04:23.670 --> 00:04:26.660
There's no point in doing the meaningless.

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:28.290
So...

00:04:30.840 --> 00:04:33.330
We want you to enter STARISH, too.

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:47.160
Revolution!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:56.600
This is the true revolution I was looking for!

00:04:57.130 --> 00:05:00.320
True revolution?

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:05.150
Revolution! The new replacing the old.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:09.700
If you've only changed yourselves,

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:12.960
your revolution has accomplished nothing!

00:05:13.240 --> 00:05:16.790
Changing yourselves, enveloping 
your surroundings with

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:20.630
the flames of your passion, 
and changing others!

00:05:20.630 --> 00:05:26.010
Once you've accomplished that, it's finally...

00:05:28.770 --> 00:05:31.910
...a revolution!

00:05:44.190 --> 00:05:51.550
STARISH passionately took to 
the Cross-Unit Project to start a revolution.

00:06:01.320 --> 00:06:04.550
The three units lit flames 
of passion in people's hearts,

00:06:04.550 --> 00:06:11.310
and those flames spread 
from person to person.

00:06:12.480 --> 00:06:15.920
I receive mountains of letters every day.

00:06:17.000 --> 00:06:20.900
And super mountains of e-mails.

00:06:26.150 --> 00:06:27.780
Even on the street.

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:35.980
And on the web.

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:40.990
The people are rising up. 
The flames are burning bright.

00:06:40.990 --> 00:06:42.750
It is the night before a revolution.

00:06:42.750 --> 00:06:48.590
And to complete your true revolution, 
I require one last thing.

00:06:48.920 --> 00:06:54.050
For QUARTET NIGHT to stand up!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:09.640
Even your rivals' hearts burn hotly and fiercely.

00:07:09.640 --> 00:07:14.740
This is the revolution I've been looking for.

00:07:14.740 --> 00:07:17.750
A super love revolution!

00:07:19.210 --> 00:07:20.620
So then...

00:07:24.070 --> 00:07:30.010
Perform at the entry concert!

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:53.410
However, there is one condition.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:04.100
The title of STARISH's entry song will be

00:08:05.690 --> 00:08:08.580
Maji Love...

00:08:09.990 --> 00:08:12.950
Revolutions!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:25.090
Wait.

00:08:28.450 --> 00:08:29.880
Thank you.

00:08:31.240 --> 00:08:32.750
Don't get the wrong idea.

00:08:33.220 --> 00:08:35.020
You're still only common fools.

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:35.910
What?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:40.120
What do you mean?

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.040
We didn't do it for you.

00:08:45.400 --> 00:08:46.790
We did it for us.

00:08:49.810 --> 00:08:51.690
Didn't you hear us earlier?

00:08:51.690 --> 00:08:55.190
There's no point in performing without STARISH.

00:08:55.720 --> 00:09:00.050
We'll perform as the 
opening artist once we're

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:02.000
the undisputed number one.

00:09:03.640 --> 00:09:06.400
We acknowledge that you've improved.

00:09:06.930 --> 00:09:10.650
That's why we'll prove that we're still better.

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:14.400
But remember what Rei-chan said at our shoot?

00:09:15.020 --> 00:09:18.190
Join us on our level.

00:09:18.710 --> 00:09:20.530
If you can, that is.

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:26.120
Let's aim even higher together.

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:32.240
I did say we'll aim higher together.

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.880
But we'll reach higher than you.

00:09:35.880 --> 00:09:39.890
We don't care if you end up dropping out.

00:09:42.700 --> 00:09:45.180
Now we're equals and rivals.

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:48.150
Perhaps "enemies" is more accurate.

00:09:48.530 --> 00:09:49.480
Yeah.

00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:52.710
We're moving out of the dorm today.

00:10:02.230 --> 00:10:04.700
They're really serious about this.

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:10.130
Yes. I could feel the heat 
of the flames burning inside them.

00:10:10.620 --> 00:10:13.760
We've been trying pretty hard until now.

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:17.090
But we'll have to try even harder.

00:10:17.400 --> 00:10:18.310
Yeah.

00:10:18.650 --> 00:10:21.600
Only one group will be chosen 
to be the opening artist.

00:10:22.360 --> 00:10:26.260
To be chosen, we must surpass QUARTET NIGHT.

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.780
To do that, we need to practice.

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:31.480
Practice, practice, practice.

00:10:31.820 --> 00:10:34.540
We wrote a wonderful song with Haru-chan.

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:37.860
Let's work to make it even more wonderful.

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:39.240
Yeah.

00:10:46.940 --> 00:10:49.610
Shiny's always full of surprises.

00:10:49.610 --> 00:10:53.160
I didn't realize his revolution 
held that much meaning.

00:10:53.160 --> 00:10:57.280
It's impressive STARISH 
rose to meet his standards.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:02.290
But QUARTET NIGHT's desire to aim 
even higher is incredible, as well.

00:11:02.880 --> 00:11:06.650
Yeah. And they're both Haru-chan's songs.

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:10.310
I'm so excited to see how it goes.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:14.570
They're not the only ones 
performing at the concert.

00:11:15.230 --> 00:11:17.500
Enka, classical music...

00:11:17.500 --> 00:11:20.160
Heavyweights of all genres are performing.

00:11:20.700 --> 00:11:26.200
I know, but ultimately, 
they'll be the last ones standing.

00:11:26.200 --> 00:11:28.250
That's what I believe.

00:11:29.690 --> 00:11:31.120
I hope you're right.

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.720
I've never seen you train so hard you sweat.

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.050
It's strange.

00:11:52.210 --> 00:11:56.990
The more we practice, 
the more I want to keep practicing.

00:11:57.420 --> 00:11:59.030
It's because of them.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:00.650
That song...

00:12:18.910 --> 00:12:21.090
What we saw was incredible.

00:12:22.800 --> 00:12:25.340
I can still feel the impact.

00:12:25.950 --> 00:12:28.960
But we will stand on top.

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.560
We must always be on top.

00:12:32.010 --> 00:12:32.960
You're right.

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:38.020
Haruka!

00:12:38.590 --> 00:12:39.680
Tomo-chan.

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:46.370
STARISH is amazing.

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.340
Yeah.

00:12:48.010 --> 00:12:52.200
I can't believe we used to study together.

00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:06.760
Back then, I never imagined 
this day would come.

00:13:07.290 --> 00:13:09.970
You guys really worked hard.

00:13:18.710 --> 00:13:20.600
Kotobuki-senpai?

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.200
You want me to rearrange the song?

00:13:28.470 --> 00:13:31.530
There was nothing wrong 
with your previous arrangement.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:32.680
It's just

00:13:33.560 --> 00:13:35.500
that our feelings have changed.

00:13:37.950 --> 00:13:42.720
After listening to STARISH's song, 
we noticed something while practicing.

00:13:43.050 --> 00:13:46.840
We'll show them what's burning inside us.

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.650
More passionately and aggressively.

00:13:53.350 --> 00:13:57.980
We tried changing how we 
sing and dance and switching around

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.930
the lyrics to create a more powerful song.

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:03.560
But it's still not enough.

00:14:03.560 --> 00:14:05.150
We need to start by changing the arrangement.

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:07.980
Very well.

00:14:07.980 --> 00:14:12.570
Turning the singers' emotions 
into song is my job.

00:14:13.090 --> 00:14:14.540
I'll do everything I can.

00:14:15.690 --> 00:14:17.410
Thanks, kiddo.

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:25.120
It's nearly time.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:27.750
Everything will be decided tomorrow.

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:31.220
My mind is like a polished 
mirror and still water.

00:16:32.660 --> 00:16:34.810
What does that mean?

00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:39.770
It means his mind is clear and calm.

00:16:39.770 --> 00:16:40.760
Really?

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:41.680
I see.

00:16:42.040 --> 00:16:45.190
I actually feel the same way, Hijirikawa.

00:16:46.540 --> 00:16:47.710
Jinguji.

00:16:48.510 --> 00:16:52.780
Let's make our dream 
of having the whole world hear

00:16:52.780 --> 00:16:54.860
our song come true.

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:58.290
Yeah. I'm so excited

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:02.960
to stand onstage with everyone 
tomorrow, my heart is pounding.

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:08.170
Tomorrow, let's show everyone 
what STARISH's music is all about.

00:17:08.400 --> 00:17:09.170
Yeah.

00:17:13.510 --> 00:17:15.300
It's tomorrow.

00:17:15.830 --> 00:17:18.010
We've done everything we need to do.

00:17:18.270 --> 00:17:21.170
Nothing is lacking anymore.

00:17:21.170 --> 00:17:23.770
Right on. Let's do this.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:42.160
<i>Dearest Grandmother,</i>

00:17:43.030 --> 00:17:45.240
<i>The day has finally arrived.</i>

00:17:46.110 --> 00:17:53.340
<i>The fateful day STARISH 
and QUARTET NIGHT have been</i>

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:56.040
<i>working for has begun.</i>

00:19:14.280 --> 00:19:15.720
It's hot in here.

00:19:15.720 --> 00:19:16.670
What?

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:20.430
I've never seen such a passionate crowd.

00:19:22.720 --> 00:19:27.340
I can feel the heat of everyone's 
hopes and excitement.

00:19:27.980 --> 00:19:28.970
Yeah.

00:19:39.590 --> 00:19:42.970
<i>Super Star Sports!</i>

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:48.470
As you know, it's the world's 
greatest sports festival.

00:19:48.880 --> 00:19:51.920
Athletes from around 
the world gather to demonstrate

00:19:51.920 --> 00:20:00.220
their power, speed, and technique 
in this premier international event.

00:20:00.870 --> 00:20:05.090
For the first time in 50 years, 
this special event will be held in our nation.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:12.270
Who will win the honor 
of starting the opening ceremony?

00:20:12.870 --> 00:20:17.610
The entry concert for that 
honorable position starts now.

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:22.770
This is the start of the night of destiny.

00:20:32.420 --> 00:20:37.780
There's no rehearsal, 
and no one knows who's performing.

00:20:38.160 --> 00:20:42.820
All we know is when we're going on.

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:45.140
It's a truly thrilling concert.

00:20:45.140 --> 00:20:48.900
<i>Who will perform first at the entry concert?</i>

00:20:47.870 --> 00:20:48.900
It's starting.

00:20:49.410 --> 00:20:52.840
<i>Shining glamorous and sexy on this dark night,</i>

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:55.150
<i>four jewels glittering with individuality.</i>

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:58.610
<i>Yes, it's QUARTET NIGHT!</i>

00:21:01.730 --> 00:21:10.380
<i>Piercing all the girls' hearts with 
his seductive smile is Kotobuki Reiji!</i>

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:18.210
<i>Wild and free, this great soul keeps the beat.</i>

00:21:18.210 --> 00:21:21.700
<i>Kurosaki Ranmaru!</i>

00:21:25.430 --> 00:21:30.200
<i>With mysterious eyes and whispers like the wind.</i>

00:21:30.770 --> 00:21:33.740
<i>Mikaze Ai!</i>

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:39.860
<i>Sometimes cold, and other times sweet.</i>

00:21:39.860 --> 00:21:45.560
<i>With the absolute zero brilliance 
of the aurora, it's Camus!</i>

00:22:23.270 --> 00:22:28.390
<i>May our voices resonating with the wind</i>

00:22:28.390 --> 00:22:32.740
<i>Reach even greater heights</i>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:37.970
<i>Turning this promised dream into a song</i>

00:22:37.970 --> 00:22:42.850
<i>Let's achieve a miracle</i>

00:22:43.130 --> 00:22:49.750
<i>Evolution forever</i>

00:22:49.750 --> 00:22:50.860
QUARTET NIGHT

00:24:06.620 --> 00:24:09.890
Watch their revolution unfold.

00:24:09.890 --> 00:24:10.880
Uta Pri!
